                  "text": "•\tImplemented BM-25, Language Model and Divergence From Randomness Model on multi-lingual tweet data using TREC-eval  to increase the MAP-scores by tuning the hyperparameters of the models.\n•\tExecuted strategies such as eDismax Query Parser, Synonym Factory ,Filter Factory and slop queries to improve the MAP-scores of the models.\n\nFramework used: Apache Solr, AWS\n"
